  "solution_ref": "$f(a)=1$, $f'(a)=3$. 접선 $y=3x-3a+1$, $-3a+1=4$ → $a=-1$. $f=x^3+px^2+qx$: $-1+p-q=1$, $3-2p+q=3$ → $p=-2$, $q=-4$. $f(1)=-5$",
